  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk | Loudon, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards & Committees   \t\t\t \n     Get Involved   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t Dog Licensing \r\n\t\t\t Election Information \r\n\t\t\t Election & Town Meeting Results \r\n\t\t\t Estimate Vehicle Registration Cost \r\n\t\t\t Request Vital Records \r\n\t\t\t Vehicle Registration - Renewal \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk \r\nTown Clerk\t\t \r\nThe Town Clerk’s Office serves as a central resource for residents, providing essential services with professionalism and efficiency. \nResidents may visit the Town Clerk’s Office to register to vote, obtain dog licenses, process vehicle registrations, and access a variety of municipal documents. \nThe office is responsible for maintaining and preserving the Town’s official records, including vital records such as birth, death, and marriage certificates.  \r\nFAQs \r\n             Where do I register to vote? \r\n             Where are you located? \r\n             What do I need to do to apply for a marriage license? \r\n             Can you give me a quote? \r\n         View All FAQs \r\n/FAQ.aspx \r\nContact Us \r\n\t\t\t\t\tAshley  Simonds\r\nTown Clerk \r\nEmail: townclerk@loudonnh.org  \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Theresa   Chudoba\r\nDeputy Town Clerk \r\nTown Clerk \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n\t\t\t\t\t 55 South Village Road \n\t\t\t\t\t Loudon ,  NH   03307 \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Mailing Address \n\t\t\t\t\t 55 S Village Road \n\t\t\t\t\t\t Suite 2 \n\t\t\t\t\t Loudon ,  NH   03307 \r\nPhone:  603-798-4542 \r\nFax: 603-798-3539 \r\nHours \nMonday, Wednesday and Thursday: 8 am to 4 pm \nTuesday: 8 am to 8 pm \r\n\t\t\t Departments & Hours \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Vehicle/Dog Renewals \r\n\t\t\t Tax Kiosk \r\n\t\t\t AXIS GIS \r\n\t\t\t Subscribe to News \r\nLoudon Town Office \r\n55 South Village Road \r\nLoudon, NH 03307 \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
